<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS share index up 3.0 pct to 495.57.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS share index up 3.0 pct to 495.57.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index rose three percent on Friday to close at 495.57 after Thursday's record 481.13, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>The total market turnover was $93.46 million, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
